-@media (max-width: 860px) and (max-height: 500px) {
+/* Phone landscape (short screens): fold the top bar into one row so the chart keeps ~170px.
+   fix-phone-sizes: landscape and at least 560 px wide (the one row needs about 500 px). A short screen that is square or
+   narrow (the Razr cover screen, 352x355) keeps the two rows: see "Short screens that are not landscape" below. */
